<title>USA: Wells Fargo unit sets $150 mln capital securities.</title>
<headline>Wells Fargo unit sets $150 mln capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of floating rate capital securities from Wells Fargo Capital Trust II, a unit of Wells Fargo &amp; Co, was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p>BORROWER WELLS FARGO CAP II</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON LIBOR +50BP MATURITY 1/30/27</p>
<p>TYPE CAPITAL SECS  ISS PRICE 99.025   FIRST PAY DATE 7/30/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    SPREAD 3MO-LIBOR   PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB		  +58.326BP   CALLABLE NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
